<title>JAPAN: BOT-Mitsubishi says to cut staff by 2,000 by 1999.</title>
<headline>BOT-Mitsubishi says to cut staff by 2,000 by 1999.</headline>
<text>
<p>TOKYO, Nov 22 (Retuer)- Bank of Tokyo-Mitsubishi Ltd said on Friday that it would cut its work force by 2,000 to total 18,000 by the end of March 1999.</p>
<p>At the end of September, its work force totalled 20,000, it said.</p>
</text>
